# One line ending everywhere: LF in the repo and in every working copy, Windows
# included. The Rust build runs in WSL against the Windows checkout, and Linux
# tools need LF: shell scripts fail on CRLF and rustfmt.toml asks for Unix newlines.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.xlsx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.wasm binary

# Generated chain data: no line-by-line diffs, collapsed in GitHub reviews.
docs/public/chainspec.json       -diff linguist-generated
deploy/scalar-local-raw.json     -diff linguist-generated
